# pack_v1_sigil.grimpack: hand-derived golden fixture of pack v1 (contract §12,
# docs/formats/pack.md, Plan 0002 WP8.3). This listing is the derivation: every field is
# written out from the format document. SHA-256 values come from Python hashlib and the
# AssetIds from an independent re-implementation of StableHasher v1, not from grimoire_assets.
# tests/pack_format.rs checks that the .grimpack file equals this listing byte for byte, that
# PackReader reads exactly the fields noted here and that PackWriter reproduces the file.
# Format: hex bytes separated by spaces; everything after "#" is a comment.

